# Project-scoped registry. The global default (registry.npmmirror.com) served a
# corrupt zod 3.25.x tarball missing its built index files, breaking installs.
# The official registry guarantees integrity, and CI installs from it by default,
# so this also keeps local and CI in sync. Delete to fall back to your global
# registry if the mirror issue is fixed.
registry=https://registry.npmjs.org